      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "The \"big thing\" is gone, yes, but that doesn't mean the whole road has vanished; it just means the map you were following is now blank. Your identity as a researcher is just a role you were playing, and roles can be shed, even if it feels terrifying right now. Think about what you *enjoyed* about the research, the small moments of discovery, not just the final outcome. Those moments are still yours, and they are the seeds for something else, even if you can't see them yet.",
